#
# Example:
#
#     Codex repeatedly introduces resource leaks.
#
# Future Codex tasks:
#
#     explicitly trigger resource-lifetime review
#     before completion
#
# This creates adaptive quality control.
#
# ============================================================
# 111. NO BLIND SELF-REWRITING
# ============================================================
#
# Agents must NOT be allowed to arbitrarily rewrite their own core prompts,
